OL,3,GNEWSABrothers make free mobility aids
OL,4,Ausing 3D printers
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo brothers from Plymouth are using 3D
OL,7,Fprinters to make life-changing mobility
OL,8,Faids for children living with
OL,9,Fdisabilities.
OL,11,FEngineers Josh and Max Dixon are part
OL,12,Fof a global network of volunteers that
OL,13,Fmakes toddler mobility trainers (TMTs)
OL,14,Fand gives them to families for no cost.
OL,16,FThe devices, which are like lightweight
OL,17,Fmini-wheelchairs, help children and
OL,18,Ftheir families get out and about.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
