OL,3,GNEWSABrothers make free mobility aids
OL,4,Ausing 3D printers
OL,5,
OL,6,FRachel, who also lives in Plymouth,
OL,7,Fsaid the mobility aid has had "a huge
OL,8,Fimpact" on her four-year-old son
OL,9,FCharlie, who has Lennox-Gastaut
OL,10,Fsyndrome - a severe form of epilepsy
OL,11,Fthat causes seizures.
